{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_4_level_main_04-03_end",
  "groupId": "main_4",
  "stageId": "main_04-03",
  "title": "人工製冷",
  "storyCode": "4-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8a14b9b0abe5d42c028965f8ecb12af116acb6563adf9d6b82d36ead60c18586",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "動作快！......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "怎麼會......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（別出聲！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（唔——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（他們還在嗎？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（還在......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（似乎是在找什麼東西——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（——有一個整合運動，望向我們這邊了！撤回掩體！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "是我的錯覺嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（能不能狙擊他們？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（我們與敵人距離太遠了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（自從他們出現以後，爆炸聲就停止了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（他們的站位很分散，我不可能一次性消滅全部三個。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（而且那些整合運動的動作，和普通的暴徒有明顯的區別。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（其他整合運動，似乎沒有那麼厚重的裝扮。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（沒錯。可見，一旦輕舉妄動，只要有一個活下來、引來更多的暴徒，我們就危險了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（再加上，其中有一個人是術師的裝扮，而且正在測試什麼的樣子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（如果他們同樣也有索敵式的法術......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（在我們的位置射出一發彈藥，他們完全有可能感覺得到。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（所以結論是不能。明明是三對三，卻像是被包圍了呢。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（有點糟糕。我很討厭這種感覺。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（獵人被更龐大的野獸逼入絕路，不得不藏起來的感覺。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（等等，他們似乎在與誰通訊——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（在這裡是聽不到內容的。讓我去。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（不行，現在移動太冒險了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（太安靜了。我們不知道敵人是什麼樣的感染者......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（如果有聽力強化的那種，可就要遭殃了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（——他們在等什麼？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（我感覺——很奇怪。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（是不是——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（潔西卡，你有沒有......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（我......我也......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（溫度又下降了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "（我......好冷......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（難道就是他們......！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（——！潔西卡，你為什麼咬住手指——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（在防止牙齒因顫抖相碰而發出聲音。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（先不說是否必要，但這種素養，真是厲害的孩子。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（在我眼裡，你也是孩子啊。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（——哈。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "（不要。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "（......回溫了。那三個整合運動也離開了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "是在測試什麼東西的功能嗎——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "——帶著冰寒一聲不響而來，帶著溫度默默離開，只留下受害者在暗處發抖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "可惡，這些傢伙，確實很像傳說中的雪怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "沒准我蒙對了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "也許他們就是雪怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "......找到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "還是遭到冰封的牆體。但是，你們看——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "牆角掩埋著黑色的源石？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "果然。寒潮是從這個地點向外釋放的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "牆體上能看到鮮明的紋路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "這塊源石就是區域降溫的中心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——我在做傭兵的時候，營房裡流傳過一陣這樣一個傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "烏薩斯西北域有一支感染者遊擊隊，一直在與烏薩斯為敵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "他們中，有一個鐵塔般的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "據說，沒有任何東西能阻止它前進。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "盾牌會被擠壓，武器會被折斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "那個怪物離開之後，留下的只有平地，滅絕了生機的平地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "而在那支遊擊隊裡，又有這樣一支小隊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "他們就像是寒冬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "他們走過的地方，全數冰結。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "建築轟然倒下，化作粉末，四散彌漫在空曠的戰場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "而戰壕中，躺滿了被凍成冰塊的烏薩斯士兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "你是覺得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "是的。我覺得他們就是那個傳說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "——“雪怪小隊”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜葉",
      "speakerId": "char_193_frostl",
      "text": "前進吧。我想我們快要找到整合運動的據點了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "唔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "隕星",
      "speakerId": "char_219_meteo",
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "你們有沒有聞到一股......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潔西卡",
      "speakerId": "char_259_Jessica",
      "text": "燒焦的味道？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
